{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Fighting Fantasy Legends",
    "steam_appid": 496340,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/657d114eb3a1e9ff0397dd5755e061eb.avif?t=1728635419\" /></div><br>Travel through the land of Allansia in your quest to become a legendary adventurer. Play through three iconic Fighting Fantasy gamebooks - City of Thieves, The Warlock of Firetop Mountain and Citadel of Chaos. Discover these classic adventures in a whole new way!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/9ebf420de9cc86935f85d8c7072477f2.avif?t=1728635419\" /></div><br>Create your own adventures in a dangerous land full of monsters, treasures and traps. From renowned authors Steve Jackson and Ian Livingstone (co-founders of Games Workshop) and Nomad Games, Fighting Fantasy Legends is an epic role-playing card game set in the classic world of Fighting Fantasy. Can you survive the dangerous streets of Port Blacksand, the murky depths of Firetop Mountain or the looming shadows of The Citadel?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/c8ac0ccc110b6296646fa17f63035105.avif?t=1728635419\" /></div><br>Featuring a dice-based combat system unique to Fighting Fantasy Legends, where you level up your dice as you play. Choose to increase your strength or your luck, so that you can increase your chances of dealing devastating damage to your opponents and evading deadly traps!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/cffb9a67377ad6c560aa13681495a637.poster.avif?t=1728635419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/cffb9a67377ad6c560aa13681495a637.webm?t=1728635419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/cffb9a67377ad6c560aa13681495a637.mp4?t=1728635419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/e0f8a87f97951a24ebf605fd3b7397b6.avif?t=1728635419\" /></div><br>Never experience the same adventure twice! Each location has treasure, monster and event cards for you to uncover, shuffled into a deck you then draw from. Will you stumble into a deadly trap? Or encounter a helpless villager looking for their saviour?<br><br>With unique cards in each location, expect danger around every turn. Unveil cards to discover fiendish creatures, powerful objects and dramatic events as you play!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/6edbe50fd2bcc3f1e8349cf85aec60b3.avif?t=1728635419\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Thousands of choices as you play, making each game unique.<br></li><li>Powerful adversaries, such as Balthus Dire, Zagor the Warlock and Zanbar Bone.<br></li><li>Kill monsters and add them to your Creature Codex.<br></li><li>Iconic characters, such as Nicodemus the Wizard, Gareth Yaztromo and O'Seamus the Leprechaun.<br></li><li>Unlockable titles and achievements for completing challenges.<br></li><li>Permadeath mode - not for the faint hearted!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/657d114eb3a1e9ff0397dd5755e061eb.avif?t=1728635419\" /></div><br>Travel through the land of Allansia in your quest to become a legendary adventurer. Play through three iconic Fighting Fantasy gamebooks - City of Thieves, The Warlock of Firetop Mountain and Citadel of Chaos. Discover these classic adventures in a whole new way!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/9ebf420de9cc86935f85d8c7072477f2.avif?t=1728635419\" /></div><br>Create your own adventures in a dangerous land full of monsters, treasures and traps. From renowned authors Steve Jackson and Ian Livingstone (co-founders of Games Workshop) and Nomad Games, Fighting Fantasy Legends is an epic role-playing card game set in the classic world of Fighting Fantasy. Can you survive the dangerous streets of Port Blacksand, the murky depths of Firetop Mountain or the looming shadows of The Citadel?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/c8ac0ccc110b6296646fa17f63035105.avif?t=1728635419\" /></div><br>Featuring a dice-based combat system unique to Fighting Fantasy Legends, where you level up your dice as you play. Choose to increase your strength or your luck, so that you can increase your chances of dealing devastating damage to your opponents and evading deadly traps!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/cffb9a67377ad6c560aa13681495a637.poster.avif?t=1728635419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/cffb9a67377ad6c560aa13681495a637.webm?t=1728635419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/cffb9a67377ad6c560aa13681495a637.mp4?t=1728635419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/e0f8a87f97951a24ebf605fd3b7397b6.avif?t=1728635419\" /></div><br>Never experience the same adventure twice! Each location has treasure, monster and event cards for you to uncover, shuffled into a deck you then draw from. Will you stumble into a deadly trap? Or encounter a helpless villager looking for their saviour?<br><br>With unique cards in each location, expect danger around every turn. Unveil cards to discover fiendish creatures, powerful objects and dramatic events as you play!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/496340/extras/6edbe50fd2bcc3f1e8349cf85aec60b3.avif?t=1728635419\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Thousands of choices as you play, making each game unique.<br></li><li>Powerful adversaries, such as Balthus Dire, Zagor the Warlock and Zanbar Bone.<br></li><li>Kill monsters and add them to your Creature Codex.<br></li><li>Iconic characters, such as Nicodemus the Wizard, Gareth Yaztromo and O'Seamus the Leprechaun.<br></li><li>Unlockable titles and achievements for completing challenges.<br></li><li>Permadeath mode - not for the faint hearted!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Create your own adventures in a dangerous land of monsters, treasures and traps. From renowned authors Steve Jackson and Ian Livingstone (co-founders of Games Workshop) and Nomad Games, Fighting Fantasy Legends is a role-playing card game set in the world of Fighting Fantasy.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Japanese, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe game manages to get over some of the hurdles of the game books quite neatly. So if this is your first trip into the classic universe, you'll probably have a damn good time.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 PocketGamer<br><br>\u201cFans of the series will love having a different way of approaching some of their favorite characters. It\u2019s an entertaining twist on the usual Choose Your Own Adventure format.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 GameZebo<br>",
